% Scenario: a 2x2 gray image. Four 8-bit samples drawn through the
% standard unit-square matrix at a translated and scaled CTM become one
% image XObject painted as `q 50 0 0 50 100 100 cm /Im0 Do Q`.
100 100 translate
50 50 scale
2 2 8 [2 0 0 -2 0 2] <0055AAFF> image
showpage
